{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve been here before. You\u2019ll be here again. Survive the nightmare that doesn't end. \u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An endless nightmare; You awaken in Ekera, the nightmarish hellscape realm of rot &amp; torment. Where the souls of the dead fight &amp; die without rest. The only way to escape is to wake up, but even death does not free you from Ekera's grasp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only your weapon, your stamina, and your will to fight, fight your way through endless hordes of damned souls as long as you can; for when you fall, and you will fall - Ekera remembers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sandrotten: Ekera is a never ending horde hack &amp; slash where you fight your way through endless hordes of tormented undead beings, with the difficulty increasing after each kill. How many can you take down before your inevitable fall?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The First Fracture","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4001140/e51e075331c5ffff0c415bbd2249213d968b23d1.jpg"},{"name":"The Vast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4001140/760cd2c6890240f949617679aa11a34e610b4ae5.jpg"},{"name":"Ascension","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4001140/5920ede8e7399219a6b01ead7045dccc817b46a5.jpg"},{"name":"Pilgrimage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4001140/c294aae535f4d062700c193c202cef283acbcfdc.jpg"},{"name":"Of Myth & Legend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4001140/3f2add90b0de9ced3ee61d55ad62fe39c927b2a4.jpg"},{"name":"Recollection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4001140/93c75e72b53b3875213f5c3d588f3d081e9fe31e.jpg"},{"name":"Unmasked","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4001140/65a8370685e12